<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.9.11">
<l>kainnākat tiṭarkaṭinta kaṉalāḻip</l>
<l rend="indent">paṭaiyuṭaiyāṉ karutuṅ kōyil</l>
<l>teṉṉāṭum vaṭanāṭun toḻaniṉṟa</l>
<l rend="indent">tiruvaraṅkan tiruppa tiyiṉmēl</l>
<l>meynnāvaṉ meyyaṭiyāṉ viṭṭucittaṉ</l>
<l rend="indent">virittatami ḻuraikka vallār</l>
<l>eññāṉṟu memperumā ṉiṇaiyaṭikkīḻ</l>
<l rend="indent">iṇaipiriyā tiruppar tāmē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Those who are able to recite [these] Tamil [verses]</l>
<l rend="indent">composed by Viṭṭucittaṉ, a true servant with a truthful tongue,</l>
<l>on the holy city of Araṅkam eternally</l>
<l rend="indent">praised by the southern and northern regions</l>
<l>[and] the temple favoured by him with the fiery discus</l>
<l rend="indent">who ended the suffering of the elephant,</l>
<l>they will always be united with our Lord’s pair of feet,</l>
<l rend="indent">never to be parted.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
